# 27MB PSO savestate: local probe/autoload asset. *.bin is an LFS rule here (.gitattributes),
# so a stray `git add -A` would push it into an already-blown LFS budget.
/state.bin

# SM64 native port (decomp -> wasm) build output. The .wasm has ROM-derived
# copyrighted assets baked in at compile time (extract_assets.py -> C data ->
# linked in; there is no --preload-file separation). This repo publishes to
# GitHub Pages -- do NOT commit or publish this directory.
n64/sm64-native/
